            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention discloses a 3D printer nozzle comprising a heating element. The heating element comprising: a first sheath (202) comprising a first inner diameter and a first outer diameter, the first sheath (202) sized to engage around an outer circumference of the 3D printer nozzle (106); at least two nichrome wire coils, at least one of which is at least partially contacting the first inner diameter of the first sheath (202); and at least one energy receiver (350) associated with the at least two nichrome wire coils, wherein the at least two nichrome wire coils comprise a high density winding at a taper portion of the 3D printer nozzle (106) at an exit port (106a) and a lower density winding along a non-taper portion of the 3d printer nozzle (106).</p>
            </abstract>
